abstract: >-
  Experimental single-RGB-webcam virtual laparoscopic practice software with
  calibrated hand tracking, separated motion channels, fixed-trocar mechanics,
  deterministic interactions and descriptive telemetry in native and browser
  implementations. Clinical validity and training effectiveness are not established.
keywords:
